+ * does, through the uclamp of the Linux thread that runs the user code (xnuhost's thread_run gives it at the release):
+ *   realtime (the render server, audio)         floor 1024, XH_HINT_REALTIME | XH_HINT_UI
+ *   UI, above-UI (an app's main thread, frames) floor 1024, XH_HINT_UI
+ *   user-initiated                              floor 768,  XH_HINT_UI
+ *   default (non-UI)                            no floor of its own (the vCPU's request: DroidVMCpufreq's interactive groups)
+ *   utility, background, darwin-background      XH_HINT_BACKGROUND: no floor and a ceiling (xnuhost, XH_HINT_BG_MAX)
