+ * app's threads are clamped to background QoS), so a backgrounded process never holds a fast core at its top clock. The
+ * GPU path in xnuhost reads the same word on the submitting vCPU (fix-gpu-perf). Interrupts masked: one store per change.
+ */
+static inline void
